@doriface/ui

src/theme/library-dark.ts and src/theme/library-light.ts hold terminal colour
palettes (background, foreground, selection, cursor, ansi0..15) taken from the
projects below through their iTerm2-Color-Schemes exports. THEMES.md lists each
theme with its project and the changes Doriterm makes.

